<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1KOR - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kor</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Bakorinti</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA MARHANZI EMWA ABAKORINTI</para>
  <para style="h">AMARHANZI EMWA ABAKORINTI</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA MARHANZI EMWA ABAKORINTI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Enshokolezi: Paolo acîmanyîsa, ahâna omusingo anavuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Paolo wahamagalagwa mpu abè ntumwa ya Yezu Kristu oku bulonza bwa Nyamuzinda, na mwene wîrhu Sositeni, <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>oku Ekleziya ya Nyamuzinda eri e Korinti, kuli balya bacêsibwe muli Yezu Kristu, bahamagalwa mpu babè batagatîfu haguma na balya boshi baderha izîno lya Nyakasane Yezu Kristu, Nnâmahanga wîrhu na Nnâhamwâbo, ngasi aha bali boshi. <verse eid="1CO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Kuli mwe enshôkano n’obuholo bw’emwa Larha Nyamuzinda na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu!<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Ntahusa kuvuga Nyamuzinda omunkwa erhi mwe murhuma kw’erya nshôkano ya Nnâmahanga mwahâbagwa muli Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Bulya muli Ye, mwayunjuzîbwe obuhirhi boshi, bulya bw’oluderho lwa Nnâmahanga boshi na bulya bw’obumanye boshi, <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>kulya kubà ebinwa bya Kristu byasêzire muli mwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Na ntyo ntà ngalo ya nshôkano mubuzire, obu mudwîrhe mwalinga okucîyêrekana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwâmi Yezu âcîyêrekana amango agaluka al’itwîra abantu olubanja luzinda. </char></note> kwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Yêne wayôrha ammuzibuhya, lyo muyêra oku Lusiku Lwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olusiku lwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, lwo lusiku ashubira en’igulu n’irenge, al’itwîra abantu boshi olubanja.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Arhatwa omu kanwa kâge oyo Nyamuzinda wammuhamagalaga omu cinyabuguma c’Omugala, Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Okurhayumvanya n’okusârhaza</para>
  <para style="s1">Ka Kristu ali muberemwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Mwe mukasinga mâshi, bene wîrhu, oku izîno lya Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, muyumvanye; mumanye mwankac’iberamwo; mubè baguma omu murhima, n’omu nkengêro. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Bulya, yâgi bene wîrhu, nayumvîrhe kuli mwe, oku bantu b’emwa Kolowe, mpu akadali kali ekarhî kinyu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Kwo kuderha oku ngasi muguma anakaderha, erhi: «Niono, ndi wa Paolo! Nâni, ndi wa Apolo! Nâni, ndi wa Kefa! Nâni niehe, ndi wa Kristu!» <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Ewe, ka Kristu aligi muberemwo? Ka Paolo ye wammubambiragwa oku musalaba? Nîsi k’ow’izîno lya Paolo mwabatizibagwa? <verse eid="1CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Mvuzire Nyamuzinda omunkwa, kulya kubà ntâye nabatizize muli mwe, kuleka Krispo na Kâyo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Ntyo kurhâbè owaderha mpu mwabatizîbwe oku izîno lyâni. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Nêci we! nabatizize n’abà aha mwa Stefana. Ntà handi nkengîre nabatizize omuntu!<verse eid="1CO 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obushinganyanya bw’igulu n’obushinganya bw’abakristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Bulya Kristu arhantumaga mpu mbatize, ci mpu mmanyîse Emyanzi y'Akalembe, na buzira okukolêsa obwenge bw’enderho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obwenge bw’enderho: Okukolêsa obwenge bw’obukengêre bwîrhu bwône; kuli kulahira okugera omu njira Nnâmahanga yêne arhutwîrîre.</char></note>, omusalaba gwa Kristu gwankashuba busha. <verse eid="1CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Nêci, oluderho lw’omusalaba liri isirhe oku mihera, ci oku bâyacire, kuli rhwe, buli buhashe bwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1, 19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Iz 29, 14</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">«Nâshaba obushinganyanya bw’abashinganyanya, nahirigisa obukengêre bw’ab’obukengêre bunji»</char>. <verse eid="1CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Omushinganyanya ngahi aligi? Ngahi aligi omuntu wasomire binji? Omurhimanya wa hano nshi ngahi abà wâni? Obushinganyanya bw’igulu ka Nyamuzinda arhabuhindulaga isirhe? <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Bulya n’obushinganyanya bwâlyo igulu lirhamanyaga Nyamuzinda omu bushinganyanya bwâge, Nyamuzinda anacilonza okuciza abemêzi n’isirhe ly’enyigîrizo zâge. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Nêci, Abayahudi bahûna ebimanyîso, nabo Abagereki balonza obushinganyanya! <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Rhwêhe rhuyigîriza Kristu, olya bamanikaga oku musalaba. Oku Buyahudi ziri nshonyi, n’oku bapagani liri isirhe, <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>ci oku bahamagale, Abayahudi n’Abagereki, Kristu ali buhashe bwa Nyamuzinda na bushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda, <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Bulya ehiri isirhe emwa Nyamuzinda, hilushire abantu obushinganyanya, n’ehiri ngonyi emwa Nyamuzinda hilushire abantu emisî. <verse eid="1CO 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Mâshi bene wîrhu, ka murharhang’ilola oku mwahamagalagwa. Abagwêrhe obushinganyanya bw’eby’en’igulu barhali banji, n’abagwêrhe obuhashe barhali banji, n’ababurhe nabo barhali banji. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Ci eliri isirhe en’igulu; lyo Nyamuzinda acîshozire, mpu ayagîrizemwo abashinganyanya; n’obulî buzamba en’igulu, bwo Nyamuzinda acîshozire, mpu abonêsemwo emisî enshonyi; <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>ehirhagwêrhi maburhwa minjà en’igulu, hirya bagayayaguza, ehyo hyo Nyamuzinda acîshozire; acîshoga ehirhahali, mpu hihirigise ehihali, <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>mpu lyo harhag’ibà eciremwa cacîbona embere za Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Bulya ye wa­mmuhisagya muli Yezu Kristu, owahindusire bushinganyanya bwîrhu w’emwa Nyamuzinda na bwimâna bwîrhu, na butagatîfu na bucunguzi bwîrhu; <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>mpu lyo nk’oku biyandisirwe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1, 31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Yer 9, 23</ref>.</char></note>, <char style="qt">owalonza obukuze, abulongeze muli Nyakasane</char>.<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Niehe, bene wîrhu, erhi nyisha emwinyu, ntayishag’immubwîra obuhamîrizi bwa Nyamuzinda n’enderho z’obukulu nîsi erhi z’obushinganyanya. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Nanga, omu karhî kinyu ntaderhaga nti manyire kandi kantu okuleka Yezu Kristu, n’olya Yezu Kristu bamanikaga oku musalaba <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Na niene; erhi ndi ekarhî kinyu, nali nka ngonyi, mwôba, nali nnandwîrhe nadirhimana. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>N’enderho zâni n’obugo bwâni birhàli nka binwa bya kuyêmêza by’obushinganyanya; ci bwàli buhamîrizi bwa Mûka n’obuhashe bwâge, <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>ly’obuyêmêre bwinyu burhayegemera obushinganyanya bw’abantu, ci obuhashe bwa Nyamuzinda yêne. <verse eid="1CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>N’obwo abakola bimâna bya bugula mbabwîriza, cikwône arhali bulà bugula bwa mw’eri igulu, arhanali bulà bw’abaluzi b’en’igulu bayish’ihirigirha. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Ci obushinganyanya rhuderha, bunali bushinganya bwa Nyamuzinda, bumanye bw’ihwe bwayôrhaga bubà bufulike, bulya Nyamuzinda ali arhubîkirebwo kurhenga embere ly’amagana g’emyâka, mpu buyish’ibà irenge lîrhu. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Obwo bushinganyanya ntà muluzi wa mw’eri igulu obuyishi, -bacibumanyaga, barhankabambire Nyakasane w’irenge oku musalaba; - <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>ci nka kulya biyandisirwe, rhudwîrhe rhwammubwîra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ebi isù lirhasâg’ibona n’irhwirhi lirhasang’iyumva…: <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Iz 64, 4</ref></char>.</char></note> <char style="qt">ebi isù lirhasâg’ibona, n’ebi okurhwiri kurhasâg’iyumva, n’ebirhasâg’isôkera omu murhima gw’omuntu, birya byoshi Nyamuzinda arheganyizagya abarnuzigira</char>. <verse eid="1CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Bulya rhwe Nyamuzinda abimanyisize n’Omûka gwâge; na Mûka ye vûlula byoshi, ciru n’amahwe ga Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Omu bantu ka hali oyishi eciba omu muntu okuleka omûka gwâge? Kwo n’okwo, ntâye oyishi amahwe ga Nyamuzinda okuleka Omûka gwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Ci rhwono, arhali mûka gw’en’igulu rhwahâbirwe, ci Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda, lyo rhumanya enshôkano Nyamuzinda arhugabîre. <verse eid="1CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Na nka rhwaziderha, rhurhaziderha omu iderha lyayigîrizibagwa n’obushinganyanya bw’abantu, ci omu iderha rhwayigîriziba­gwa na Mûka; ye manyîsa eby’omûka omu iderha ly’omûka. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Omuntu ocîkubagira oku bwôge yênene, arharhimanya ebirhenga emwa Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda, bulya kuli ye liri isirhe, arhankanabimanya, bulya ebyo bimanyikana n’oburhabâle bwa Mûka. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Omuntu ocîkubagira Mûka yêhe, atwa emmanja za ngasi byoshi, ci yêhe arhatwîrwa na ndi. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Ndi okola omanyire ebi Nyakasane agerêrîze, akaderhaga mpu amuhanûla? Ebi Kristu agerêrîze rhwêhe rhubigwêrhe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nkaba co canarhumire abwîra abaganda oku bali bîra gâge, lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 15:15">Ywn 15, 15</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Bene wîrhu, niehe ntahasha okummushambâza nka bantu bacîkubagira Mûka, ci nka bantu bacîkubagira eby’omubiri, nka bâna barhò muli Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Mpyuhyu nammuhîre nti munywe, ci ntammulisagya biryo bizibu; bulya murhankashubir’ibigala; ciru na buno murhankashub’ihasha, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>kulya kubà mucicîkubagira eby’omubiri. Oku haciri obwâgalwa n’akadali ekarhî kinyu, k’erhi murhaciri bantu bacîkubagira eby’omubiri obwo, k’erhi n’olugendo lwinyu lurhali nka lwa bantu kwône obwo? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Bulya mubwîrana, mpu: «Niono, ndi wa Paolo», n’owundi, mpu: «Nâni, Apolo ye ndikwo», ka kurhali kwa bantu kwône okwo?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukolo gw’abajà-bugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Apolo aligi cici? Na Paolo aligi cici? Bashizi bammuhisagyakwo obuyêmêre, na ngasi muguma wa muli bo nk’oku Nyakasane amushobôzize. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Nie ono nazindaga nahinga, Apolo adômera; ci Nyamuzinda ye wakuzize emburho. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>N’ohinga arhali cici, n’odômera kwo na kwo, ci okuza emburho yêne Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Ohinga n’odômera bo baguma, ci ngasi muntu ayish’ihembwa nk’oku anakozire. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Bulya kugwâsa rhugwâsa Nyamuzinda; muli ishwa lya Nyamuzinda, muli bûbake bwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1CO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Nk’oku nanal’impîrwe enshôkano ya Nnâmahanga, naj’aho, nabanda ibuye lirhanzi omu ciriba, nka kula omûbasi mwinjà anajira. Owundi ayubakirakwo. Ci ngasi muguma alole bwinjà kurhi ayûbasirekwo. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Bulya ntâye wankabanda ecindi ciriba kuleka ecihali, kwo kuderha Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>E­erhi omuntu ankayûbakirakwo eco ciriba n’amasholo, erhi n’ebyûma, erhi n’a­mabuye g’engulo ndârhi, erhi n’emirhi, erhi n’obukere, nîsi n’obwâsi, <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>omukolo gwa ngasi muguma gwanayish’ibonekana. Olusiku lwanaguyêrekane, bulya olwo Lusiku omu muliro lwayish’imanyirwa, n’ogwo muliro gwo gwâmanyîse omulimo gwa ngasi muguma nk’oku gunali. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Obûbake bw’omuntu erhi bwankasêra oku ciriba, nnabo anahâbwa oluhembo. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Obûbake bw’omuntu erhi bwankagulumira, nnabo anahona; yêhe anacira yêne, cikwône nka owagera omu bwihîrà.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Ka murhamanyiri oku muli nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda n’oku Omûka gwa Nyamuzinda gummulimwo? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Erhi hankajira owashâba aka-Nyamuzinda, Nyamuzinda anamushâbûla. Bulya aka-Nyamuzinda kabà katagatîfu, n’ako ka-Nyamuzinda, mwe ko.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Ntâye ocîrhebage yêne! Muli mwe erhi hankajira owacîkebwa mpu ali mushinganyanya omu masù g’eri igulu, acîjire musirhe ly’abà mushinganyanya; <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>bulya obushinganyanya bwa mw’eri igulu bubà isirhe omu masù ga Nyamuzinda. Kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abarhimanya anabagwârhe omu mirhego y’amenge gâbo, <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Ayu 5, 13</ref></char></char></note>: <char style="qt">«Ye gwakiza abashinganyanya omu mirhego yâbo»</char>; <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>na kandi, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aha halinzir’ishusha, Lul <char style="xt" link-href="PSA 94:11"><ref loc="PSA 94:93--1">94(93), 11</ref></char>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">«Nyakasane ayishi enkengêro z’abashinganyanya»; arhahabiri oku ziri za busha</char>. <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Ntyo, ntâye ocîkuzizagye irenge ly’abantu; bulya byoshi biri binyu: <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>abè Paolo, abè Apolo, abè Kefa, libè igulu, bubè buzîne erhi lufù, bibè by’ene erhi b’irhondo, byoshi biri binyu; <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>ci mwoyo mubà ba Kristu, na Kristu abà wa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Kuziga kukwânîne barhulole nka barhumisi ba Kristu, nk’abarhumirwe naye okugabira abantu amahwe ga Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amahwe ga Nyamuzinda bwo buhirhi bwoshi bw’enyigîrizo n’obuzîne Larha Nnâmahanga amanyîsize anashobôza abantu. Omu katekisimu bakâg’idôsa, mpu: «Myanzi ya Kalembe ehi Yezu arhubwîzire?» Ishuzo, mpu: «Emyanzi y’Akalembe Yezu arhubwîzire yeyi: Nyamuzinda ye Sho omuzigira, alonzize muyôrhe nka bâna bâge hano igulu.»</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Nêci, bahûna abarhumisi, kuli kubà nkubagirwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Niehe ntankababala erhi, nankaderhwa mwinjà erhi mubî ninyu, nîsi erhi aha ngombe y’abantu. Nâni niene ntankacîtwîra olubanja. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Omurhima gwâni ntâco guntumuzize, ci arhali kwo kuderha oku ndi mwêru-kwêru. Omutwî w’emmanja wâni, ye Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Kuziga murhatwaga olubanja lwa bene dubaduba. Muleke Nyakasane ayishe, ye wash’imoleka ebifulike omu mwizimya, anabishûle emihigo eri omu murhima. Okubundi ngasi muguma ayish’ihâbwa na Nyamuzinda obukuze bumukwânîne.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Muli ebyo byoshi, bene wîrhu, nacîjizire lwîganyo rhwe n’Apolo erhi mwe murhuma. Nalonzagya nti murhuyigirekwo ogu mugani: «Ntâco kulusha ebyayandisirwe», lyo harhajira owacîbonera muguma mpu alushire owundi; <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Ndi wakuhâga ecirhuma orhumânini n’abandi? Cici ojira orhahâbagwa? N’a­kabà kuhâbwa wacihâbagwa, câ cirhuma walimbira abandi nka kulya arhali kuhâbwa wahâbagwa? <verse eid="1CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Lêro mukolaga muyigusire! Lêro mukolaga muli bagale! Buzira rhwe mukola bâmi! Ciru mucibâga bâmi, nîrhu rhukayîma haguma ninyu! <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Bulya, kwo ncîkebirwe, Nyamuzinda arhujizire bikabulirwa, rhwe ntumwa, nk’abatwîrîrwe okufà. Nêci, rhwabîre masheka omu masù g’igulu na bamalahika n’abantu: <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Rhwono rhuli basirhe erhi Kristu orhuma, ninyu muli bîrhonzi muli Kristu; rhwono rhuli ngonyi, ninyu muli ba-misî; mwoyo muli bakengwa, nîrhu bagaye. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Ciru na buno rhuli bufà n’ishali, n’enyôrha, n’okubula ehi rhucîbwîsire; rhudwîrhe rhwalibuzibwa, na ntâho rhujira rhwankahanda. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Rhudwîrhe rhwarhindibuka n’okukola n’enfune zîrhu. Badwîrhe barhujâcira, nîrhu rhubahè obwangà; badwîrhe barhulibuza, nîrhu rhucîhumbire; <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>badwîrhe barhubêshera, nîrhu rhwanarhûliriza. Rhwabirage nka bijandagwa by’igulu na nka camvu ca boshi kuhika ene.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Ntayandisiri ebyo nti mmubonêse nshonyi, ci kuderha nti mmukalihire kulya omuntu akalihira abâna bâge bazigirwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Bulya ciru wankajira balezi bihumbi n’ebihumbi muli Kristu, basho barhali banga. Nêci, niene nammuburhaga n’Emyanzi y’Akalembe muli Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Mmuhûnyire, mâshi mwe mukonkwa, mushimbe olwiganyo lwâni. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Co canarhumaga nammurhumira Timoteyo, mugala wâni ntonya n’okwânîne okucîkubagirwa muli Nyakasane; a­mmukengêza oku nyôrha n’oku nyigîriza muli Kristu, kulya nanyigîriza hoshi hoshi omu Ekleziya zoshi.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Erhi bacîkêbwa mpu nkaba ntayisha emwinyu, baguma babirigirhana n’obucîbone. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Cikwône ndi hôfi h’okummuyishira, Nyakasane akulonza; niene namanya abo babirigirhîne n’obucîbone, nabamanyira kw’ebi bankahash’ijira, ci arhali oku binwa byâbo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Bulya Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda burhaba omu binwa, ci omu bijiro. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Cici mucîshozire? Ka mulonzize mmuyishire n’eminyuli, nîsi erhi mulonzize nyishe n’obuzigire n’omurhima gw’obutûdu?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Murhenze obubî ekarhî kinyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Emyanzi ejîre yarhenga emwinyu, bya nshonyi byône byône, ciru na birya birhajirwa omu bapagani, kuhika muguma muli mwe ayanka muk’îshe! <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>E­erhi munadwîrhe mwabirigirhana n’obucîbone obwo! ahâli h’okujà omu mishîbo, ly’oyo muntu wajiraga ntyo ammurhengamwo! <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Niehe, ciru akabà ntali muli mwe n’omubiri, ndi muli mwe n’omûka, n’olw’oyo muntu wajiraga ntyo, mîra nalutwâga nka kulya ho nali. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Kukwânîne, oku izîno lya Nyakasane Yezu, rhujè haguma, mwoyo n’omûka gwâni, haguma n’obuhashe bwa Nyakasane Yezu <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>n’oyo muntu akwêbwe Shetani, omubiri guherêrekere, ly’omûka gwâge gucira Olustku lwa Nyakasane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyo mukristu mubî ali mukage omu Ekleziya: anakola ahîrwe Shetani mpu amuhane. Ci ahâbirwe obwo buhane mpu lyo acîyunjuza, lyo n’omûka wâge guyish’icunguka.</char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Obucîbone bwinyu burhali bwo! Ka murhamanyiri oku hya-bunya-lwango hisungunu hinarhume omugati gwarhundûka? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Mucîsêze, mucîrhenzekwo engeso nkulûkulù, muhiduke mugati muhyâhya, bulya muli mugati gurhalimwo lwango. Bulya Kristu, ye Mwâna-buzi wa Basâka, abazirwe. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Kuziga olusiku lukulu rhurhalujiraga n’engezo nkulûkulù, nîsi erhi n’olwango lw’obubî n’olw’obulyâlya, ci n’omugati muhyâhya gurhalimwo lwango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emwa Abayahudi, bakâg’ikabulira omugati gwa mîra oku lwa Basâka, barhâlyaga ogurhali mugati muhyâhya gurhalimwo lwango erhi ngezo. Oku mukristu, omugati gwa mîra, zo ngeso mbî n’omuhyâhya gwo murhima muhyâhya guli nk’ogwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu.</char></note>, gwo murhima gucîre n’ogw'okuli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Omu maruba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ago maruba marhanzi gahezire.</char></note>, erhi nyandika nti mumanye mwankashangîra n’abarhaba nshonyi, <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>ntaderhaga kuguma oku bumaguza ba mw’eri igulu, nîsi erhi abazigira ebirugu by’en’igulu n’ebishungu, erhi abaharâmya ebiremwa. Acibâga ntyo, murhankacibezire en’igulu. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Nammuyandikîre nti mumanye mwa­nkakômera ngasi yêshi oderhwa mwene wîrhu akabà ali mumaguza, nîsi erhi akabà azigira ebirugu by’en’igulu, erhi aharâmya ebiremwa, akabà asîma okujâcirana, nîsi erhi akabà abà mulalwè erhi cishungu; omuntu wa bene oyo, ciru mumanye mwankalira haguma naye. <verse eid="1CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Abâli embuga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abâli embuga: Kwo kuderha abarhali omu mulala gw’Abemêzi, omu Ekleziya.</char></note>, cici mbashimbîre nti nabatwîra olubanja? Kali abâli omu ndalâlà bo mutwîra olubanja ninyu? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Abâli embuga, Nyamuzinda wâbatwîre olubanja. Omubî mumurhenze ekarhî kinyu.<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Okurhajîsa bene winyu lubanja aha ngombe y’abapagani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Owa muli mwe erhi acibà agwêrhe olubanja boshi n’owâbo, k’anaderhage mpu aluhêka aha ngombe y’endyâlya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezo ndyâlya, bo batwî b’emmanja barhali bemêzi, bo bapagani barhajira bushinganyanya.</char></note> ahâli h’okuluhêka aha ngombe y’abashinganyanya? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Nkabaga murhamanyiri oku abashinganyanya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abashinganyanya bayish’itwîra igulu olubanja, haguma na Kristu, ye mutwî w’emmanja mukulu.</char></note> bo bayish’itwîra igulu olubanja. N’akabà mwe mwayish’itwîra igulu olubanja, ka murhakwânîni okutwa ezo mmanja za busha-busha? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Ka murhamanyiri oku rhwayish’itwîra bamalahika olubanja? Emmanja za hano igulu ka zirhuyabirage? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Nka muli­kwo olubanja, mwêhe munaluhêkerage balya Ekleziya egaya mpu balutwe! <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nkudesire nti lêro enshonyi zimmugwârhe! Kuziga murhalimwo mugula wa­nkafunga bene wâbo! <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Onabonage omukristu ahêka owâbo mukristu aha ngo­mbè, n’okwo embere z’abapagani! <verse eid="1CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Kunakola kuhimwa okwo, erhi muhêkana aha balume mwene na mwene. K’erhi murhaleka bakammunyaga erhikwo? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Ci mwêhe mubâge mwe mujira okurhashingânîni, mubâge mwe munyaga abinyu, n’obwo bali bene winyu!<verse eid="1CO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Ka murhamanyiri oku abajira okurhashingânîni barhakayîma omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda? Mumanye mwankacîrheba! Oli abajira eby’enshonyi, oli abaharâmya ebiremwa, oli abagonyi, oli ab’engeso mbî, oli entazi, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>oli ebishambo, oli abasîma eby’en’igulu, oli abalalwe, oli abakajâcira abâbo n’ebishungu, abo boshi barhalimwo owayîme omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Okwôla baguma muli mwe bakuli. Ci mwacîshusire, mwacêsîbwe, mwajizirwe bêru-­kwêru oku izîno lya Nyakasane Yezu Kristu n’omu Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaz’iyâka eby’enshonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>«Ntâco ntagwêrhi obuyêmêre bw’okujira»; ci arhali byoshi bigwêrhe akamalo, «Ntâco ntagwêrhi obuyêmêre bw’okujira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebyo binwa abantu babî bakâg’ibiyumva n’okubikolêsa kubî.</char></note>», ci niono ntankalonza okubà mujà wa kantu kalebe. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Ebiryo biri bya nda, n’enda eri ya kulya; ci Nyamuzinda ayashabûle enda n’ebiryo. Ci omubiri gwôhe gurhali gwa kujira e­by’enshonyi; ci guli gwa Nyakasane, na Nyakasane ali wa mubiri. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Na Nyamuzinda wafûlaga Nyakasane, ânarhufûle nîrhu n’obuhashe bwâge.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Ka kuhaba muhabire oku emibiri yinyu biri birumbu bya Kristu? Njag’iyanka ebirumbu bya Kristu, mbijire birumbu bya mukazi wa cirala? Kubêsha! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Nîsi ka kuhaba muhabire oku olungana n’omukazi w’ecirala, banashube mubiri muguma bo naye? Bulya kudesirwe, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aha hakengezize <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Murh 2, 24</ref></char>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">«Bombi bashuba mubiri muguma.»</char> <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Ci olungana na Nyakasane yêhe, anashube mûka muguma gwône bo naye. <verse eid="1CO 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Kaz’imuyâke eby’enshonyi! Ngasi câha omuntu ankahash’ijira, cirharhenga omu mubiri gwâge. Ci ojira eby’enshonyi, yêhe mubiri gwâge ahemukira. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Nkabaga murhishi oku omubiri gwinyu kali ka-Nyamuzinda ka Mûka Mutagatîfu ommubâmwo; oyu mwahâbagwa na Nyamuzinda, n’oku murhaciri binyu mwene? <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Bulya kugulwa mwaguzirwe! Kuziga muhè Nyamuzinda irenge omu mibiri yinyu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Enyigîrizo za ngasi lubero</para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhya n’obulamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Rhulolage birya mwanyandikiraga. Kuli kwinjà omulume arhahume oku mukazi. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Cikwône akaga k’okujira kubî karhumire, kukwânîne ngasi mulume abè na mukâge, na ngasi mukazi abè n’îba. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Omulume ajire ebi arhegisirwe okujirira mukâge, naye omukazi ajire ebi arhegesirwe okujirira îba: <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Omukazi ntà buhashe agwêrhe oku mubiri gwâge, ali w’îba. Omulume naye kwo na kwo, ntà buhashe agwêrhe oku mubiri gwâge, ci ali wa mukâge. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Harhajiraga owalahirira owâbo; ci bombi banayumvanya, kuhika kasanzi kalebe, lyo mujira nsiku mwashenga. Okubundi mushub’ishubira haguma, Shetani alek’ibona igwârhiro ly’okummushumika erhi buzamba bwinyu burhuma. <verse eid="1CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Okwo ndesire lirhali irhegeko, ci kummufà lukogo. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Nankasîmire boshi babè akâni; ci ngasi muntu ahâbwa na Nyamuzinda yâge yâge nshôkano, muguma eyi, owundi era.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Cikwône abalamba n’abakana mbabwîzire oku kuli kwinjà kuli bo bayôrhe akâni. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Ci bakabà barhankahash’icîlanga, bajè omu buhya; bulya aha omuntu ankahya, ankajà omu buhya.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Nabo abayankîne, alagi irhegeko mbahîre; câba arhali nie, ci Nyakasane: Omukazi amanye ankaleka ibà. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>N’erhi ankamuleka, arhajaga oku wundi mulume, erhi bashub’iyumvanya bo n’ibà. Naye omulume amanye ankahulusa mukâge.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Abandi, niene mbabwîzire, arhali Nyakasane, nti: «Erhi mwene wîrhu muguma ankabà agwêrhe omukazi orhali mwemêzi, n’oyo mukazi ayêmêre okubêra bo naye, arhamuhulusagya». <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>N’erhi omukazi ankabà agwêrhe omu­lumè orhali mwemêzi, n’oyo mulume ayêmêre okubêra bo naye, arhamulekaga. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Bulyâla omulume orhali mwemêzi acêsîbwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okulungana n’omwemêzi, kuli nka kujà omu cinyabuguma c’abâna ba Nnâmahanga; n’okuburhwa omu mulala gw’abakristu, kuli kuburhwa omu cinyabuguma ca Ekleziya.</char></note> na mukâge, n’omukazi orhali mwemêzi acêsîbwe n’ibà oli mwemêzi. Acibâga birhali ntyo, rhinga abâna binyu bazinzire. Ci buno bali bacêse. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Ci olya orhali mwemêzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwo kuderha omukristu muli bo, aleke orhali mukristu acîshoge okubêra haguma erhi nanga.</char></note> erhi ankalonza okugenda, anagende; omu kwa bene okwo, olya mwene wîrhu erhi mwâli wîrhu barhali bashwêke: bulya Nnâmahanga ammuhamagîre mpu mulere n’omurhûla. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>K’omanyire, we mukazi, erhi wâciza balo? K’omanyire, we mulume, erhi wâciza mukâwe?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Aha nyuma ly’okwôla, ngasi muguma ayôrhe nk’oku Nyakasane anamugabîre, kulya anali erhi Nnâmahanga amuhamagala. Kwo nyigîriza ntyo omu Ekleziya zoshi. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Akabà lebè ali mukembûle erhi ahamagalwa, oyo amanye arhakûlaga obukembûle bwâge. Orhali mukembûle amango ahamagalagwa, amanye ankaciziga bamukembûla. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Okukembûlwa kuli busha, n’okurhakembûlwa nakwo kuli busha; okushimba amarhegeko ga Nyamuzinda kwône. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Ngasi muguma ayôrhe oku anali ayôsire erhi ahamagalwa na Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Ka wali mujà erhi ohamagalwa? Orhacîyîrhiraga okwo. Ciru wankabà ohashire okurhenga omu bujà, olonze obunguke mw’obwo bwôrhere bwâwe bw’o­bujà. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Bulya owali mujà erhi ahamagalwa muli Nyakasane, Nyakasane amukûzire omu bujà. Kwo na kwo, orhali mujà erhi ahamagalwa, akola mujà wa Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Kugulwa mwaguzirwe! Mumanye mwakacîjira bajà ba bantu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Bene wîrhu, ngasi muguma abêre omu bwôrhere izù lya Nnâmahanga lyashangaga alimwo.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Oku balamba, ntagwêrhi irhegeko lya Nyakasane ci ihano kwône nahâna, nka muntu okwânîne okucîkubagirwa oku bwonjo bwa Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CO 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Ncîkebirwe, nti, oku kuli buno kurhumire, obwo bwôrhere bwo bukwânîne; nêci, o­kwo kwo kuli kwinjà oku ngasi muntu. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>K’oli mushwêke oku mukazi? Orhacilonzagya okushwêkûlwa. K’orhali mushwêke oku mukazi? Orhacilonzagya mukazi. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Ci erhi wankayanka omukazi, orhajiziri câha; n’omunyere erhi ankayankwa, arhajiziri câha. Ci abo boshi bayumva amalibuko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malibuko g’obunyumpa.</char></note> omu mubiri gwâbo, go nannonzize okummuyâsa. <verse eid="1CO 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ntya kwo mmubwîzire, bene wîrhu: amango gayôfihire. Ntyo abagwêrhe abakazi, babè nka kulya barhabagwêrhi; <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>abadwîrhe balaka, nka kulya barhalaka; abashagalusire, nka kulya barhashagalusiri; abagula, nka kulya barhagwêrhi bici; <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>abadwîrhe balya eri igulu, nka kulya barhadwîrhi balya. Bulya obusù bw’eri igulu burhimanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nakasîmire muyôrhe buzira malibuko. Omuntu orhagwêrhi mukazi, ashîbirira ebya Nyakasane, alonza kurhi ankasimîsa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Omuntu ogwêrhe omukazi, ashîbirira eby’en’igulu, alonza oku ankasimîsa mukâge; <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>na ntyo ali muberemwo. Omukazi orhagwêrhi mulume n’omunyere, bashîbirira e­bya Nyamuzinda, balonza okubà batagatîfu omu mubiri n’omu murhima. Ci omukazi waherusire, ashîbirira eby’en’igulu, alonza oku ankasimîsa ibà. <verse eid="1CO 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Okwo nkudesire oku bunguke bwinyu, arhali kuderha nti mmuhîre omu murhego, ci nti mmuhise omu bwôrhere bwinjinjà, bulya buhà omuntu okusêra­kwo Nyakasane buzira okumugaba.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Cikwône erhi omuntu ankakenga abonêsa omunyere wâge enshonyi omu kumuleka akulûluka, n’erhi ankabona oku okwo byanabà ntyo, ajire nk’oku alonzize; erhi ntà câha ajizire: amuleke ayankwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Ci erhi omuntu ankasêra omu mihigo y’omurhima gwâge arhanasêzibwi na ndi, ci oku bulonza bwâge yêne ahige omu murhima okuyôrhana omunyere wâge, erhi ajizire bwinjà. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Ntyo owahà omwâli omulume erhi kwinjà ajizire, n’orhamuhîri mulume erhi ajizire kwinjà kulusha.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Omukazi, oku ibà anacirimwo omûka anali mushwêkere kuli ye; ci erhi ibà ankafà, nyamukazi anashwêkûlwa, anahash’ijà omu mw’oyu alonzize, cikwône muli Nyakasane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">okujira obuhya muli Nyakasane kw’omukana erhi mushumbalume: Arhankajà omu mw’orhali mukristu.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>N’obwo, kwo mbwîne, anabona omurhûla kulusha erhi ankayôrha oku anali. Ncîkebirwe nti nâni njira Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Enshusho z’abazimu ziri busha; Nyamuzinda ali muguma yêne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Oku gw’enyama zarherekîrwe enshushano, rhumanyire oku rhweshi rhugwêrhe obwenge. Obwenge kurhûnza burhûnza, ci obuzigire bwo buyûbaka. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Omuntu wacîkebwa mpu amanyire akantu, erhi arhacimanya nk’oku bikwânîne. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Ci erhi omuntu ankasîma Nyamuzinda, anamanyibwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okumanyibwa na Nyamuzinda, omu Mandiko matagatîfu, kuli kurhona omu masù gâge.</char></note> na Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Kuziga oku gw’enyama zarherekîrwe abazimu, rhumanye oku enshushano y’omuzimu erhali cici en’igulu, na ntà wundi Nyamuzinda kuleka olya muguma. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Bulyâla ciru hakabà banyamuzinda b’obwîhambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abo banyamuzinda n’abo banyakasane b’obwîhambe bo bazimu.</char></note> emalunga na hano nshi, -na ntyo hali banyamuzinda banji banji na banyakasane banji banji-, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>kwône kuli rhwe rhwêne hali Nyamuzinda muguma yêne, ye Larha, ye na cisisi c’ebintu byoshi, ye mwanalemeragwa, na Nyakasane muguma yêne, ye Yezu Kristu, orhuma byoshi bihabà, onarhuma rhuhabà.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">igwârhiro ly’obuzigire: okurhasârhaza abazamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Cikwône obwenge burhali bwa boshi. Baguma, kulya kubà bakomerîre e­nshushano z’abazimu kuhika buno, banalye enyama z’enterekêro nka nterekêre, na ntyo omurhima gwâbo, bulya guli muzamba, banayumva gwa mazinga. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Nanga, arhali ebiryo byo birhhushegezaho Nnâmahanga. Erhi rhwankabà rhurhabilîrikwo, rhurhaheze cici; n’erhi rhwankabiryakwo, ntà bunguke. <verse eid="1CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Ci mumanye olugendo lwinyu muli okwo lurharhumaga abazamba basârhala. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Bulyâla, erhi omuntu ankakubona, we ogwêrhe obwenge, oli oku cîbo omu ngombe y’abazimu, k’okwo kurhali kuhà oyo muzamba omurhima gw’okulya oku nyama zarherekîrwe abazimu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Na ntyo obwenge bwâwe bwanarhuma oyo muzamba ahera, oyo mwene wîrhu Kristu afîraga! <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Omu kubîhira bene winyu ntyôla n’omu kubayâgaza omurhima gunali muzamba, Kristu mubîhîre. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Co cirhumire, erhi ankabà ebiryo byanarhuma mwene wîrhu asârhala, ntà­nkacifa nalîre enyama bundi, lyo ntag’irhuma mwene wîrhu ahirima!<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwiganyo lwa Paolo: kuhanûla Emyanzi y’Akalembe n’okucîbabaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Ka ntali ntagengwa? Ka ntali ntumwa? Ka mwoyo murhali mulimo gwâni muli Nyakasane? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Akabà oku bandi ntali ntumwa, kuli mwe mwêhe ndi yo; bulya mwoyo, mwe cimanyîso c’obugo bwâni muli Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Balya bakambêshera, oku mbashuzize kw’oku: <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Ka rhurhankalya rhunanywe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«kulya n’okunywa» omu kurhabâlwa n’abemêzi.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Ewe, ka rhurhankahash’ikulikirwa n’omukazi mwemêzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyo mukazi mwemêzi (<char style="tl">ἀδελφὴν γυναῖκα</char> mukazi mwâli wîrhu omu buyêmêre) wakâg’ikulikira entumwa, ali wa kubarheganyiza ebikwânîne, lyo barhag’iheza amango n’okushîbirira ebiryo n’enyambalo.</char></note>, aka ezindi ntumwa, n’aka bene wâbo Nyakasane, n’aka Kefa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Nkabaga rhwêne rhwêki, rhwe na Barnaba, rhwe rhurhayêmêrirwi okurhakola? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Musirika ohi olyûla yêne omukolo gwâge? Ndi ohinga omuzâbîbu arhanalye oku mburho yago? Ndi oyâbula obusò arhananywe oku marhà g’obwo busô?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>K’okwo ndesire liri iderha lya bantu kwône? K’irhegeko lyoki lirhakudesiri? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Omu Irhegeko lya Mûsa mwo kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Lush 25, 4</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">«Empanzi ehûla emburho, orhayishwêkaga akanwa»</char>. Ka Nyamuzinda anashibirire empanzi? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>K’arhali rhwe rhurhumire aderha ntyo? Nêci, okwôla rhwe kwayandikiragwa: ohinga kukwânîne ahinge erhi analangâlire, n’ohûla emburho erhi analangâlire oku ayigwêrhekwo ecâge cigabi. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Obûla rhwamîraga aminjà g’omûka muli mwe, ka kuligi kwa kusômeza erhi rhwankasarûla oku binyu by’en’igulu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Akabà abandi bagwêrhe obuhashe bw'okujira ntyo kuli mwe: ka rhurhabalushiri? Ci rhwêhe rhurhakolêsagya obwo buhashe; ci rhunakaz’ilembera byoshi, nti lyo rhurhag’ifukira Emyanzi y’Akalembe ka Kristu enjira. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Ka murhamanyiri oku abakola omu ka-Nyamuzinda, ka-Nyamuzinda kababîka, n’oku abakola aha luhêrero, kugabâna bagabâna n’oluhêrero? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Ntyo Nyakasane naye arhegesire mpu abajà bayigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe, babîkwe n’Emyanzi y’Akalembe.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Cikwône niehe ntà buhashe ciru n’obuguma nakolêsize mw’agwo, ntanayandisiri ebyo byoshi nti lyo mubinjirira. Nfè erhikwo ahâli h’okuderha nti omuntu aheze irenge lyâni! <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Bulya okuhanûla Emyanzi y’Akalembe lirhali igwârhiro lya bukuze kuli nie; ntagwêrhi oku nankabula bwakujira. N’erhi na­nkaba ntayigîrizizi Emyanzi y’Akalembe, erhi namâhera! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Acibâga ogwo mulimo ngujira omu kulonza kwâni, nêci, singa nankwânîne oluhembo; ci akabà kurhali kulonza kwâni, kwo kuderha oku buli burhindisi nahâbirwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Oluhembo lwâni luligi luhi? Lw’olu: omu kuyigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe, nyihâne buzira kuhembwa, ndeke okukolêsa obuhashe mpîrwe n’Emyanzi y’Akalembe.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Nêci, n’obwo nali ntagengwa oku bantu boshi, nacîjizire mujà wa boshi, nti lyo ncungula banji bwenêne. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Omu Buyahudi nacîjizire Muyahudi, nti lyo ncungula Abayahudi. Omu bantu barhegekwa n’Irhegeko, nacîjira muntu w’Irhegeko, n’obwo ntali w’Irhegeko, nti lyo ncungula abarhegesirwe n’Irhegeko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irhegeko lya Mûsa eryo bàdesire ahâla.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Omu barhajira irhegeko, nacîjira muzira-irhegeko, n’obwo ntali muzira-irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda, bulya ntegesirwe n’irhegeko lya Kristu, nti lyo ncungula abarhajira irhegeko. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Nacîjira ngonyi omu ngonyi, nti lyo ncungula engonyi. Nacîjira byoshi kuli byoshi, nti lukabà lufù, kakabà kalamo, kuhika ncizemwo baguma. <verse eid="1CO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>N’ebyo byoshi Myanzi y'Akalembe mbijirira, nti lyo nshangîra aminjà gâyo.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Ka muhabire oku abajà mashigwè g’okulibirha, boshi balibirha, ci muguma yêne ohâbwa oluhembo? Kuziga mulibirhe ninyu, lyo muhâbwa oluhembo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Ngasi ojà mashigwè analeke byoshi. Kuderha mpu ahâbwe obukuze bwa lusiku luguma. Rhwêhe irenge rhukolera liri ly’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Na nâni kwo ndwîrhe nalibirha ntyo, arhali aka orhamanyiri emunda ayêrekîre; kwo ndwîrhe nalwa ntyo, arhali aka owashûrha omu cirêre. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Omubiri gwâni nangubambule, ngujire cifa, nti nakabà namâbwîriza abandi nnambul’itumula.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwîrhonzi n’olwiganyo lw’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Bulya, yâgi bene wîrhu, ntalonza muhabe: balarha boshi bakâg’ilangûlwa enjira n’ecitù, boshi bayikiraga enyanja, <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>boshi bacêsibwa muli Mûsa omu citù n’omu nyanja, <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>boshi balya kalyo kaguma k’enyanya, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>bànanywa boshi cinyôbwa ciguma c’enyanya. Bakâg’inywa oku mîshi g’omu ibuye ly’enyanya lyàli libalusize; n’eryôla ibuye lwàli lwîganyo lwa Kristu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akalyo k’enyanya, gwo mâna, n’ecinyôbwa c’enyanya, go mîshi garhengaga omu ibuye. Amâna n’amîshi g’omu ibuye, biri lwîganyo lw’Obukanstiya.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Cikwône banji muli bo barhasimîsagya Nnâmahanga; kwarhuma emibiri yâbo yalambama omu mpinga. <verse eid="1CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Ebyôla byàbîre mpu lyo rhubonerakwo olwiganyo, mpu lyo rhulek’ibà n’enyifinjo mbî akâbo. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Murhagashanizagya enshushano z’abazimu aka baguma muli bo, kulya biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Lub 32, 6</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">«Olubaga lwatamala mpu balye bananywe, okuhandi banaciyimuka mpu basâme</char>». <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Rhumanye rhwankajira eby’e­nshonyi aka baguma muli bo; bahungumukamwo bihumbi makumi abiri na bisharhu omu lusiku luguma. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Rhurharhangulaga Nyakasane aka baguma muli bo; enjoka zabaherêrekeza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">enjoka zabaherêrekeza: <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 20-21">Mib 20—21</ref></char>; erhi bagalamira enjoka y’omulinga bafuma; lwîganyo Kristu acîshozire: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Ywn 3, 14</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Murhacîdudumaga aka baguma muli bazigululwa na Kaheza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lush 9, 8, okucîduduma: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16">Lub 16</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Ebyo byoshi byabayishîre mpu bibè lwîganyo, byanayandisirwe mpu rhubonereho, rhwe rhwahika omu nsiku nzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ensiku nzinda gwo ganôla mango, kurhenga okuyisha kw’Omucunguzi kuhika okuyûrha kw’igulu.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Ntyo, ocîkebirwe mpu ayîmanzire, amanye ankahirima. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Ntà mango musâg’igwârhwa n’amashumi galushire emisî y’omuntu. Akanwa ka Nyamuzinda karhagaluka; arhankaziga mwashumikwa okulushire emisî yinyu. Ci haguma n’amashumi, ammuhà oku mwagafuma n’emisî mwagagalamwo.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiryo by’enterekêro. Okurhayinjibana n’abagashâniza abazimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Co cirhumire, yâgi bîra bâni, muyâke okugashâniza enshushano z’abazi­mu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nammushambâza kulya omuntu ashambâla n’abantu bagwêrhe obukengêre mwene muyumve oku ndesire. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Akabehe k’omugisho rhugisha, ka burhali bushangîre bw’omukò gwa Kristu? Omugati rhubega, ka burhali bushangîre bw’omubiri gwa Kristu? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Kulya kubà omugati guli muguma gwône, ciru rhukaluga, rhuli mubiri muguma gwône, bulya rhweshi rhushangîra ogwo mugati muguma. <verse eid="1CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Mulole Israheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israheli w’obwôrhere bw’omubiri, ye Israheli w’en’igulu, Israheli w'ababula-buyêmêre. Ekleziya yo Israheli wa Nyamuzinda, Israheli w’abemêzi, Israheli w’okunali.</char></note> nk’oku ali oku bwôrhere bw’omubiri. Ka abalya ebi barherekêraga erhi barhalungîni n’omulinzi barherekêreragaho? <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Kwo kuderha kurhi okwo? Ka kuli kuderha oku enyama barherekîre enshushano ziri kantu? Nîsi ka kuligi kuderha oku enshushano kali kantu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Nanga! Ci ebi barherekêra, bashetani babirherekêra, ci arhali Nyamuzinda birherekêrwa. Ntanalonza mushangîre n’abashetani. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Murhakanywêra oku kabehe ka Nyakasane, mukanashub’inywêra oku kabehe k’abashetani. Murhankasha­ngîra ecîbo ca Nyakasane, mukanashub’ishangîra ecîbo c’abashetani. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Nkaba­ ga kutula rhwalonza okutula obwâgalwa bwa Nyakasane? Ka kulusha rhumulushirage misî?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhasârhaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>«Ntâco ntagwêrhi obuyêmêre bw’okujira»; ci arhali byoshi bigwêrhe akamalo. «Ntâco ntagwêrhi obuyêmêre bw’okujira»; ci arhali byoshi biyûbaka. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Ntâye olonzagye obunguke bwâge yêne, ci alonze obw’abandi. <verse eid="1CO 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Mulye ngasi byoshi baguza omu cibuye, buzira kudôsa erhi kuyôboha omurhima gwayish’immulya kurhuma. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Bulya igulu libà lya Nyakasane n’ebimubà byoshi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Lul 23, 1</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Erhi omuntu orhali mwemêzi ankakuhamagala okanayêmêra okujà emwâge, onalye ngasi hyoshi akakusholôlera, buzira kudôsa erhi kuyôboha omurhima gwayish’ikulya kurhuma. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Cikwône erhi ankakubwîra, erhi: «Ebi byarherekîrwe abazimu», orhabiryagakwo, erhi olya wakubwîraga orhuma bo n’omurhima gwâge. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Omurhima ndesire, gurhali ogwâwe, ci ogw’owundi. Bulya cici cankarhuma nie ntagengwa narhegekwa n’omurhima gw’owundi muntu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Erhi nankalya akantu nanavuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa, cici cankacirhuma nagayirwa akantu ndwîrhe navugira omunkwa? Okujira byoshi oku izîno lya Nyakasane n’okuhà abandi olwiganyo lwinjà. <verse eid="1CO 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Kuziga kubîre kulya, kubîre kunywa, na ngasi hyoshi mwankajira, byoshi mubijire oku kukuza Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Mumanye mwankasârhaza Abayahudi, nîsi erhi Abagereki, nîsi erhi Ekleziya ya Nyamuzinda, <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>nk’okûla niono ncîsêza okusîmîsa boshi omu ngasi kantu. Ntalonza bunguke bwâni, ci bunguke bwa banji, nti lyo bacunguka.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Munyige nk’okûla nâni nyiga Kristu.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku abakazi bakwânîne okuyôrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Mmusîmire bulya omu ngasi kantu munankegêre, na bulyâla munakâshimba emigenzo nammusigiraga. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Cikwônene nnonzize mumanye oku ngasi mulume Kristu ye Nnawâbo; n’omukazi nnawâbo ye mulume; naye Kristu nnawâbo ye Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Omulume washenga erhi owalêba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okulêba kuli kuderha n’obuzibu bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu ebinwa by’okuhanûla abandi n’okubarhabâla, okusoma omu mirhima n’okumanyîsa ebyayish’ibà. </char></note> n’irhwe libwîke, anabonêsa nnawâbo enshonyi. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Ci naye omukazi washenga erhi owalêba n’i­rhwe lirhali libwîke, anabonêsa nnawâbo enshonyi; bulya erhi kw’ali nk’ohalanguzîbwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Omukazi erhi ankaleka okucîbwîka irhwe, amomagwe n’emviri nazo! Ci akabà ziri nshonyi oku mukazi okukûlwa emviri erhi okuhalanguzibwa irhwe, abwîke irhwe lyâge!<verse eid="1CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Omulume yêhe kurhakwânîni acîbwike irhwe, bulya ali nshusho anali bulangashane bw’irenge lya Nyamuzinda. Naye omukazi ali bulangashane bw’irenge ly’omulume <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Bulyâla arhali omulume ye warhengaga oku mukazi, ci omukazi ye warhengaga oku mulume; <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>arhanali omulume ye walemeragwa omukazi, ci omukazi ye walemeragwa omulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Okwôla kwo kurhumire ku­kwânîne omukazi ayambale omu irhwe ecimanyîso c’obukulu bw’ibà erhi ba­malahika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamalahika bo bali nka balanzi b’omurhûla omu ndêko z’abemêzi; okuderha oku bamalahika bali aha abemêzi bali omu ndêko, kuli kuyêmêra kulya Yezu aderhaga oku amango babiri erhi basharhu bakacîgusha omu izîno lyâni nâni nanabà ekarhî kâbo. Nnâmahanga bamalahika akolêsa okuyegera abantu; lolà ya Gabriyeli, Rafaeli na Mikaele; na bamalahika b’abâna bakabona obusù bwa Nyamuzinda burhahusa, <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mat 18, 10</ref></char>. </char></note> bàrhuma. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Câba, muli Nyamuzinda, ntà mulume buzira mukazi, na ntà mukazi buzira mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Bulyâla, nêci, omukazi oku mulume arhengaga, ci n’omulume naye mukazi omuburha, na byoshi kuli Nyamuzinda birhenga.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Lêro mwene mulutwe. Ka kukwânîne omukazi ashenge Nnâmahanga n’irhwe lirhali libwîke? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>K’obwôrhere bw’omuntu bwône burhammuyigîriza oku ziri nshonyi oku mulume okujira emviri ndîrî-lîri, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>ci oku mukazi liri irenge okujira emviri ziri ntyo? Bulya ahâbagwa emviri mpu zibwîkire irhwe lyâge. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Hakabâga osîmire okujà kadali, rhwêhe rhurhakômerera kwa bene okwo, n’Ekleziya za Nyamuzinda zirhakukômera.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishêga lya Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Obûla ndwîrhe nammuhanûla, (lekagi mmubwîre oku) ntammusîmiri bulya okujà kwinyu haguma kurhammujirira minjà, ci mabî. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Burhanzi, nayumvîrhe mpu amango muli haguma omu ndêko, muli mwe hânabè abaciberûla, n’okwôla nkuyêmîre obwo, ci arhali kwoshi. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Nêci, kukwânîne habè empiriri muli mwe, lyo abantu b’enkômedu zikomîre bamanyikana. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Mwêhe erhi mwac’ijà haguma, kurhaciri kuderha mpu mulye Ishêga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishêga likengeza lirya lshêga ly’olwa-Kani lutagatîfu, erhi Mwâmi Yezu ajira Obukaristiya, anahà entumwa zâge irhegeko ly’okukâjira akâge. Abakorinti bakâg’irhang’ilya, bananywe embere ly’okurherekêra enterekêro y’Emisa.</char></note> lya Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Bulya erhi muhika oku cîbo, ntà kucilinda abandi, ci ngasi muguma ajekwo alya e­byâge yêne; na ntyo oku baguma bafà n’ishali, abandi erhi balalusire. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Nkaba­ga murhajira emwa bînywè mwankalira munanywe? Nîsi erhi kugaya Ekleziya ya Nyamuzinda n’okulimbira abarhagwêrhi bici? Kurhi nammubwîra lêro? Ka mpu mmukuzagye? Nanga, ntammukuzizi kuli okwo.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Nêci, nâni ebi nabwîragwa na Nyakasane byo nammuyigirizize: Obudufu Nyakasane Yezu agwarhagwamwo, ayanka omugati, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>n’erhi abà amâvuga omunkwa, agubega, erhi: «Eci guli mubiri gwâni gwahânwa mwe murhuma; ninyu mukâjira ntyo lyo munkengêra». <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Kwo na kwo, erhi bayûs’ilya, anaciyanka akabehe, erhi: «Aka kabehe eri ndagâno mpyâhya y’omukò gwâni; mukâjira ntyo ngasi kunywa lyo munkengêra». <verse eid="1CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Nêci, ngasi kulya kw’ogu mugati na ngasi kunywa kw’aka kabehe, erhi mumanyîsize olufù lwa Nyakasane, kuhika olusiku anayishe. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Co cinarhumire, ngasi yêshi olya kw’ogwo mugati erhi onywa kw’ako kabehe ka Nyakasane arhanakwânîni, ayish’ijisibwa lubanja erhi mubiri n’omukò gwa Nyakasane birhuma.<verse eid="1CO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Kuziga ngasi muguma acîjè emurhima, agal’ilya kw’ogwo mugati ananywe kw’akwo kabehe. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Bulya owalya n’okunywa arhanakengiri oku guli Mubiri gwa Nyakasane, erhi kulya alîre n’okunywa olufù lwâge. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Eco co cirhumire muli mwe banji bali balwâla, n’abandi bali bazamba, na barhali banyi bafîre. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Acibâga rhucîjà emurhima, rhinga rhurhahêkwa lubanja. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Nyakasane akarhuhêka lubanja erhi kurhukoma arhukoma, lyo rhulek’ihanwa haguma n’igulu.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Muyumvirhage obwo, bene wîrhu, amango muyishire haguma omu Ishêga, munalindane. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Erhi hankajira oshalisire, analîre aha mwâge, lyo mulek’ijîra haguma okuyish’ihanwa. Ebindi niene nâbikomeza amango nâyisha.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Enshôkano za Mûka Mutagatîfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Eby’enshôkano za Mûka Mutagatîfu, bene wîrhu, ntalonzizi mubihabe. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Erhi muciri bapagani, ninyu mwene murhakuhabiri, mwakâg’ibona bammusunikire ebwa nshushano z’orhuduma. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Co cirhumire nammubwîra­kwo: ntà muntu wankabà adwîrhe aderhezibwa na Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda akabul’iderha mpu «Yezu akahera», na ntâye wankaderha mpu «Yezu ye Nyakasane», arhanali oku buhashe bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Empiriri z’enshôkano n’obugula bwâzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Nêci, nshôkano za Mûka ziri za ngasi lubero; ci Mûka ali muguma yêne. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Hali na mbero nyinji z’oburhumisi, ci Nyakasane ali muguma yêne. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>N’emikolo guli mwandu, ci Nyamuzinda anali muguma yêne okola byoshi muli boshi. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Cikwônene Mûka acîyêrekana muli ngasi muguma oku bunguke bwa boshi. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Baguma bàhîrwe na Mûka iderha ly’obushinganya, n’abandi bashobôla iderha ly’obumanye muli oyôla Mûka muguma yêne. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Baguma bahîrwe obuyêmêre muli oyôla Mûka muguma yêne, n’abandi enshôkano y’okufumya muli oyôla Mûka muguma yêne. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Hali owahabirwe obuhashe bw’okujira ebisômerîne, n’owundi ahâbwa enshôkano y’obulêbi; baguma bahîrwe enshôkano y’okumanya ebiri omu murhima, abandi enshôkano y’okumanya endimi, n’abandi enshôkano y’okuzihugûla. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Ci ebyo byoshi bijirwa na Mûka muguma yêne, ye nagabira ngasi yêshi enshôkano zâge nk’oku analonzize yêne.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olwiganyo lw’omubiri gw’omuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Nka kulîra omubiri gubà muguma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kulya omubiri gulunga ebirumbu gunabijira biguma, kwo Kristu naye alunga abakristu boshi anabajira baguma omu Ekleziya.</char></note>, erhi gunagwêrhe birumbu binji, na nka kulîra ebirumbu by’omubiri bibà mwandu, binabul’ijira mubiri muguma gwône, kwo Kristu naye ali. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Na nîrhu Mûka muguma rhwabatizibagwamwo rhweshi; mpu lyo rhubà mubiri muguma gwône; Abayahudi n’Abagereki, abajà n’abarhali omu bujà, na mweshi Mûka muguma rhwanywesîbwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Kwo binali omubiri cirhabà cirumbu ciguma cône, ci binji haguma. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Okugulu erhi kwankaderha, erhi: «Ntali kuboko; kuziga ntali w’oku mubiri», k’okwôla kunarhumage kurhabà kw’oku mubiri? <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Nako okurhwiri erhi kwankaderha, erhi: «Obu ntali isù, kuziga ntali w’oku mubiri», k’okwôla kunarhumage kurhabà kw’oku mubiri? <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Omubiri gwoshi gucibaga isù, singa okurhwiri ngahi kubà? Gwoshi gucibaga kurhwiri, izulu singa ngahi libà? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Câba Nyamuzinda agwîsire ebirumbu byoshi byoshi ngasi ciguma omu mubiri nk’oku anali alonzize. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Byoshi bicibaga cirumbu ciguma, omubiri singa ngahi guli? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Ci ebirumbu bibà binji, n’omubiri gubà muguma. <verse eid="1CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Ntyo isù lirhankabwîra okuboko, erhi: «Ntakulagiririkwo»; irhwe nalyo lirhankabwîra amagulu, erhi: «Ntà bulagîrire bwinyu ngwêrhe». <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Ciru ebirumbu by’omubiri rhubona birhajira nsimiko, byo rhulagîrirekwo kulusha. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>N’ebirhuderha mpu byo byankakengwa okunyi, byo rhukenga kulusha ebyâbo. Na ntyo ebirumbu rhubonera enshonyi byo rhukenga kulusha; <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>ci ebirumbu rhurhabonera nshonyi ntà bulagîrire bigwêrhe bw’okukengwa. Na Nyamuzinda, omu kulema omubiri gw’omuntu, ebirumbu birhajira lukengwa byo ahîre okukengwa kulusha, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>mpu lyo omu mubiri mulek’ibà obwîyungule, ci mpu lyo ebirumbu bikaz’ishîbirirana. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Cirumbu ciguma cikababala, ebindi birumbu byoshi binababale bo naco. Cirumbu ciguma cikaja irenge, ebirumbu byoshi binashagaluke haguma naco.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Na ninyu muli mubiri gwa Kristu, munali birumbu ngasi muguma muli mwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Omu Ekleziya hali abà Nyamuzinda ajizire: burhanzi ntumwa obwa kabiri balêbi, bwa kasharhu bigîriza; okuhandi ahiraho obuhashe bw’okujira ebisômerîne, n’enshôkano z’okufumya, n’ez’okurhabâla abâli omu bulagîrire n’ez’okurhegeka, n’ez’okuderha endimi za ngasi lubero. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Ka boshi baligi ntumwa? Ka boshi baligi balêbi? Ka boshi baligi bigîriza? Ka boshi bajira ebisômerîne? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Ka boshi bagwêrhage enshôkano y’okufumya? Ka boshi baderha endimi? Ka boshi bahugûla endimi?<verse eid="1CO 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzigire yo nshôkano elushire ezindi zoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Mulwîre enshôkano zikulîre ezindi. Ciru nankola nammuyêreka: enjira elushire ezindi zoshi.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Ciru nankamany’ishambâla endimi z’abantu n’eza bamalahika, nka ntà buzigire ngwêrhe, erhi kwo nandi mulinga muvuze, nîsi erhi nka kula ecûma c’amarhale cikomombe cirhengamwo izù. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Ciru nankabà ngwêrhe obuhashe bw’okulêba, nkanamanya amahwe goshi; n’amenge goshi; ciru na­nkagwârha obuyêmêre bwimâna, bulya bwankamanyula entondo, nka ntà buzigire njira, erhi nnandi busha. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Ciru nankagabira abakenyi ebi njira byoshi, omubiri gwâni ciru nankagufomeka wa ngulumira, nka ntà buzigire ngwêrhe, erhi bunali busha.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Obuzigire burhûla;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:4">obuzigire burhabâlana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:4">obuzigire burhayâgalwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:4">obuzigire burhahalanjika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:4">burhanacikunga;<verse eid="1CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>obuzigire burhajira akantu karhakwânîni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:5">burhacîlongeza, burhaba burhè, burhanabîka mujina.<verse eid="1CO 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Obuzigire burhasîma okubî kukâbà, ci busîma okwinja kukâbà.<verse eid="1CO 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Obuzigire bubabalira byoshi, buyêmêra byoshi, bulangâlira byoshi, bunalembera byoshi.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Ntà mango obuzigire bwâhwe. Ci amalêbi gohe kuyûrha gâyûrhe; endimi kuguguma zâgugume; amenge kuhirigirha gahirigirhe. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Bulya ebi rhuyishi bibà bya bihimbi n’ebi rhulêba bibà bya bihimbi. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Amango ebimâna byâyisha, eby’ebihimbi byanayêgûka. <verse eid="1CO 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Erhi nciri mwâna murhò, nakâg’iganîra nka murhumba nakâg’ikagerêreza nka murhumba, nanakarhimanya nka murhumba, ci erhi mbà mulume, naleka eby’eburhò. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Buno rhucidwîrhe rhwabonera omu cilolero olubwibwi lurhuli omu masù, ci ago mango rhwayish’ibona bwinjinjaa amasù omu masù. Buno obumanye bwâni buli bwa bihimbi, ci ago mango nâmanya nk’oku mmanyirwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nka kulya Nyamuzinda ammanyire</char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Buno obuyêmêre n’obulangâlire n’obuzigire ho biri oku binali bisharhu; cikwône muli ebyo ecikulîre ebindi bwo buzigire.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Empiriri z’enshôkano zigwêrhe amakwânane kuli boshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Mucîsêze okubona obuzigire; mulongereze n’enshôkano za Mûka Mutagatîfu, ci bwenêne enshôkano y’obulêbi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Bulyâla oderha omu ndimi mwandu, arhali bantu aderheza, ci Nyamuzinda. Ntâye omuyumva, ci anakaderhezibwa na Mûka ebirhankayumvîkana. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Omuntu olêba yêhe, bantu aderheza, kuyigîriza ayigîriza, kuhanûla ahanûla, kurhûliriza arhûliriza. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Oderha ndimi nyinji, yêne ocîyigîriza; olêba, ayigîriza endêko y’abemêzi. <verse eid="1CO 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Ntankabaga mweshi muderhe ndimi mwandu, nanasîma kulusha mulêbe; bulyâla olêba alushire oderha endimi, akabà owaderha endimi arhahugwîri, lyo endêko y’abemêzi erhenzamwo enyigîrizo.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Bene wîrhu, erhi nankammuganîza omu ndimi, erhi kwinjà kuci mmujirirage, akabà ntâco mmufulûlire, n’akabà ntâco mmumanyîsize, n’akabà ntâco mmulêbîre na ntâco mmuyigîrizize? <verse eid="1CO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Kwo biri ntyo ebirhajira buzîne, akarhêra erhi olulanga, erhi byankayumvîsa izù; kurhi omuntu ankamanya bici akarhêra kazihire, nîsi erhi olulanga, akabà amazù gâbyo garhatwîkanusiri bwinjà? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Nagwo omushekera erhi izù lyâgwo lyankabà lirhatwîkanusiri, ndi wankashîbirira mpu ajà oku bîrha? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Ninyu kwo n’okwo; erhi olulimi lwinyu lwankabà lurhadesiri ebinwa bihumanusire, kurhi bankayumva ebi mudesire? Erhi omu cirêre mudwîrhe mwaganîrira. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Omu igulu muli ntishi mpiriri inga za ndimi, na ntà luguma lurhayumvîkana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Ci erhi nankahaba eci enderho zidesire, nanabà munya-mahanga kuli olya waderha, n’odwîrhe waderha anabà munya-mahanga kuli nie. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Ntyo ninyu, kulya kubà mudwîrhe mwalonza e­nshôkano za Mûka, mucîsêze okulushana mulizo, lyo endêko y’abemêzi erhenzamwo obunguke. <verse eid="1CO 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Co cirhumire, oderha endimi, akwânîne ashenge enshôkano y’okuzihu­gûla. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Bulya erhi nankashenga omu ndimi, omûka gwâni gwanashenga, ci ntà bunguke obukengêre bwâni bwankakulamwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boshi banamubona emurhima, banamanya erhi ali mwinjà erhi mubî.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Kurhi omuntu ankajiraga o­bwo? Nanashenga n’omûka gwâni, nanashenga n’obukengêre bwâni; nanayimba n’omûka gwâni, nanayimba n’obukengêre bwâni. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Câba erhi wankakuza Nnâmahanga omu mûka mwône<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu mûka mwône, erhi omu lulimi lurhamanyikini.</char></note>, kurhi omuntu kwône ankashuza «Amen!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enyigîrizo ziyêrekîre ecinwa cikulu «AMEN», lolà nyabangere.com; «Amen» kuli kuderha «Nêci ntyo» omu kufundika isâla, erhi omu kuyêmêra enyigîrizo rhwayumvagya, kandi erhi omu kuderha oku olubanja lutwirwe bwinjà.</char></note>» oku munkwa gwâwe, arhanamanyiri bici odesire? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Nêci, okuvuga omunkwa kwâwe kuli kwinjà, cikwône owundi arhankarhenzamwo enyigîrizo. <verse eid="1CO 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Mvuzire Nnâmahanga omunkwa, bulya nanderhere omu ndimi kummulusha mweshi; <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>cikwône omu ndêko y’abemêzi, nsîma kulusha okuderha binwa birhanu n’obukengêre bwâni, lyo nyigîriza abandi nabo, ahâli h’okuderha bihumbi ikumi omu ndimi.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Bene wîrhu, murhabâga bâna barhò nka mwarhimanya. Oku bubî, nêci, mubè bâna barhò, ci omu kurhimanya, mubè bantu bakulu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Kuyandisirwe omu Marhegeko, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14, 21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Iz 28, 11-12</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">«Olu lubaga naluyigîriza n’abantu baderha olundi lulimi n’omu kanwa k’abantu b’ihanga, barhanayumvîrhize obwo»</char>, kwo Nyakasane adesire. <verse eid="1CO 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Kwo kuderha oku enshôkano y’endimi cinali cimanyîso, arhali oku bemêzi, ci oku barhali bemêzi; ci obulêbi bwôhe burhali bw’abarhali bemêzi, ci buli bwa bemêzi. <verse eid="1CO 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Erhi Ekleziya yoshi yankajà haguma, n’erhi boshi bakaderhera mu ndimi, nabo abarhamanyiri kurhi bigenda erhi abarhali bemêzi erhi bankajamwo, ka barhankaderha mpu kusiraha musirahire? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Ci erhi boshi bankabà badwîrhe balêba, n’erhi hankayisha orhali mwemêzi nîsi erhi orhîshi emunda bija, boshi banamuyâgîriza, boshi banamutwîra olubanja; <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>ebifulisirwe omu murhima gwâge byanafulûlwa. Obwo anacîrhimba oku idaho, anayûbika obusù, aharâmye Nyamuzinda, anaderhe, erhi: «Okuli, Nnâmahanga ali ekarhî kinyu».<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku bakaz’ijira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Kurhi rhwaderhaga, bene wîrhu? Mukajà haguma, ngasi muguma anabà agwêrhe olwimbo, erhi enyigîrizo, erhi obulêbi, erhi enshôkano y’okuderha e­ndimi, erhi ey’okuzihugûla. Ebyo byoshi bijirwe omu kulonza okuyûbaka. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Akabà ndimi badwîrhe baderha, babè babiri erhi basharhu bône, banaderhe muguma muguma; na muguma ahugûle. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Akabà ntâye wankahugûla, banahulike, barhaderhaga omu ndêko y’abemêzi; ngasi muguma aciderhese yêne, anaderhese Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Abalêbi, babiri erhi basharhu baderhe, n’abandi bagere enderho zâbo. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Cikwône, erhi muguma mwo balya bahali ankafulûlirwa akantu, omurhanzi anahulike. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Bulya mweshi mwanahash’ilêba muguma muguma, lyo boshi bayigîrizibwa banahâbwe omurhima. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Abalêbi kukwânîne barhegeke emyûka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emyûka y’abalêbi, bwo bumoleke babonamwo ebifulike n’ebyâciyisha. Omulêbi w’okuli kukwânîne arhabè nk’olimwo isirhe, ci arhegeke obulêbi bwâge, burhag’imuhabula bunahabule abandi. Abimâna, erhi abatagatîfu, bo bemêzi, erhi abaganda ba Kristu, abakristu.</char></note> yâbo, <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>bulya Nyamuzinda arhali Nyamuzinda wa kavulindi, ci wa buholo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Nk’omu zindi Ekleziya zoshi z’abimâna, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>abakazi bakaz’ihulika omu ndêko; bulya ntà bwêmêre bagwêrhe bwa kuderha; ci kukwânîne bayôrhe bali n’obukenge, nk’oku Irhegeko lyône lidesire. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Erhi bankalonza okumanya ka­ntu kalebe, babwîze bibà omu mwa bâbwè; bulya ziri nshonyi oku mukazi okushambâlira omu ndêko. <verse eid="1CO 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>K’akanwa ka Nyamuzinda emwinyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emyanzi y’Akalembe yarhangiriraga e Yeruzalemu, yalumîra omu igulu lyoshi. Kuziga, Abakorinti bakwânîne bashimbe olwiganyo lw’Ekleziya za mîra kubalusha.</char></note> kahubukaga? K’emwinyu yône kahisire? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Akabà hali ocîkebirwe mpu ali mulêbi nîsi erhi mpu Mûka Mutagatîfu odwîrhe amubwîriza, amanye oku ebi mmuyandikîre liri irhegeko lya Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>N’orhakumanyiri, erhi naye arhanayishibwi na Nnâmahanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N’orhayishibwi na Nnâmahanga erhi ali mujà-bugo wa bunywesi, ali akolêsa kubî enshôkano za Mûka Mutagatîfu.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Kuziga, bene wîrhu, mushwîre enshôkano y’obulêbi, murhanahanzagya abaderha endimi. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Cikwône byoshi bijirwe bwinjà bwinjà na buzira kavulindi.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="ms1">III. Okufûka kw’abafîre</para>
  <para style="s1">Okufûka kwa Yezu n’okufûka kwîrhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Bene wîrhu, nammukengeza erya Myanzi y’Akalembe nammubwîrizagya, mwayiyankirira, munaciyisêziremwo buzibu, <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>yo yanammuciza erhi mwankayilanga nk’oku nammubwîragayo. N’akabà arhali ntyo, erhi mwayêmîre bya busha. <verse eid="1CO 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Burhanzi, nammuhisakwo ebi nâni niene nahâbagwa: oku Kristu afirîre ebyâha bîrhu nk’oku Amandiko gadesire, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>oku abishirwe omu nshinda, n’oku olusiku lwa kasharhu àfûsire nk’oku Amandiko gadesire; <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>n’oku àbonekîre Kefa, abul’ibonekera na balya ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Okuhandi àbonekera bene wîrhu magana arhanu na kulusha caligumiza, na banji muli bo ho bacibà, ci baguma bafîre. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Ashub’ijaho, àbonekera Yakôbo, àbonekera n’entumwa zoshi. <verse eid="1CO 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Cazînda àmbonekera nâni nka kula ankabonekera ecimomano.<verse eid="1CO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Nêci, nie munyi omu ntumwa zoshi, ciru ntakwânîni izîno ly’entumwa, bulya nalibuzize Ekleziya ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Cikwône eri nshôkano ya Nyamuzinda yanjiraga okûla ndi, n’enshôkano anshobôzagya erhagumbaga muli nie. Ci nie nakozire kubalusha boshi! Câba nanga, arhali nie, ci enshôkano ya Nyamuzinda haguma nâni.<verse eid="1CO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Akabà nie, erhi akabà bo, kwo rhuyigîriza ntyôla; kwo mwanayêmîre o­kwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>N’akabà bayigîriza oku Kristu afûsire omu bafù, kurhi baguma muli mwe bankaciderhaga mpu ntà bufûke bw’abafîre? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Akabà ntà bufûke bw’abafîre, Kristu naye arhafûkaga! <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>N’akabà Kristu arhafûkaga, enyigîrizo zîrhu ziri busha, n’obuyêmêre bwinyu nabo buli busha. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Ciru nîrhu erhi rhwamâbà bahamîrizi babêshera Nyamuzinda, bulya rhwamunywerhîre nti afûsize Kristu n’obwo arhamufûlaga, akabà kwo binali abafù barhafûka. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Bulyâla akabà abafîre barhafûka, Kristu naye arhafûkaga. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>N’akabà Kristu arhafûkaga, obuyêmêre bwinyu buli busha, munaciri omu byâha binyu; <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>kuziga n’abafîre muli Kristu baherêrekîre. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>N’akabà muli obûla buzîne bw’en’igulu mwône rhulangalîre Kristu, omu bantu boshi erhi rhwe rhunali bahanya kulusha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bulya omukristu acîhirira eby’en’igulu mpu lyo ayish’ibona amasîma g’empingu. Akabà ntà bulangâlire rhugwêrhe bw’okuyish’ihika omu mpingu, rhuli bingolongolo rhunali bahanya!</char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Cikwône nanga Kristu afûsire omu bafù, àshokolera abagwishîre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Mandiko matagatîfu, okugwishira kwo kufà.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Bulyâla muntu wadwîrhe olufù, kwo na kwo muntu wadwîrhe okufûka kw’abafîre. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Nêci, nka kulya boshi bafà muli Adamu, kwo na boshi bayish’ishubira­mwo omûka muli Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Cikwône ngasi muguma omu gâge mango: Kristu ye murhanzi-rhanzi, kandi abayish’ibà ba Kristu olusiku ayisha. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Okuhandi bwanabà buzinda, go mango ashubiza Nyamuzinda Îshe obwâmi, amâyûs’ishâba amâmi goshi na ngasi burhegesi na ngasi buhashe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ago mâmi n’obwo burhegesi n’obuhashe ayish’ishâba go mâmi n’oburhegesi n’obuhashe bwa balya barhalonza Kristu abayimemwo.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Nêci, kukwânîne ayîme kuhika ahebe abashombanyi bâge boshi ah’idako ly’amagulu gâge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 110:1."><ref loc="PSA 110:109--1">Lul 110(109), 1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Omushombanyi muzinda wayish’ishâbûlwa, lwo Lufù; <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>bulyâla Nyamuzinda ahizire byoshi ah’idako ly’amagulu gâge. Ci amango aderha mpu byoshi biri idako ly’amagulu gâge, rhumanye n’obwâlagale oku Olya wamuhâga ebi­ntu byoshi arhaganjira muli byo. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>N’amango ebintu byoshi byoshi byâbà bikola biri idako ly’amagulu gâge, naye Omugala yêne anacîhira idako ly’Olya wamuhâga byoshi, lyo Nyamuzinda ashuba byoshi muli boshi.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Acibâga birhali ntyo, balya babatizibwa abafù barhumire, singa bunguke buci barhôlamwo? Acibâga abafîre barhafûka ciru n’ehitya, cici cirhuma bacibatizibwa ahâli hâbo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkaba; erhi omukatekumeni afaga buzira kubatizibwa, Abakorinti bakâg’imujirirako ebijiro n’ensengero ziri nka za Bubatizo, lyo barhabâla omûka gwâge okuhika mwa Nnâmahanga.</char></note>? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Nîrhu rhwêne, cici cirhuma rhucîhira omu kaga ngasi kasanzi? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Ngasi lusiku erhi ndi omu lufù, bene wîrhu; n’okwo kunali nk’okûla muli irenge lyâni muli Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Acibâga bunya-muntu bwône bwarhumaga nalwîsa ebiryanyi e Efezi, singa bunguke buci nali nakûlamwo? Akabà abafîre barhafûka, «rhulyage rhunanywe, bulya irhondo rhwafà»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Iz 22, 13</ref>.</char></note>, <verse eid="1CO 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Mumanye murharhebagwa: «Okukômera ababî kunasherêze engeso nyinjà». <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Murhenge omu balalwe nk’oku bikwânîne, murhanacihîra mukajira ebyâha; bulya muli mwe hali abarhishi Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abakorinti baciri nka balalwe erhi ngeso zâbo z’ecipagani zirhuma.</char></note>. Nkudesire nti e­nshonyi zimmugwârhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kurhi abafîre bayish’ifûka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Haligi kwône owaderha, erhi: «Kurhi abafîre bâfûke wâni? Mubiri guhi bâgalukane?» <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Eci cihwinja! Eci orhwera cirhajamwo buzîne cirhanarhanzir’ifà. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Na nka warhwêra, arhali omubiri gwamurhenga gw’orhwera, ci mburho yône orhwera bûmubûmu kulyâla enali, nka ngano erhi yindi mburho. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Nyamuzinda ye oyihà omubiri nk’oku yêne alonzize, na ngasi mburho omubiri gwâyogwâyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Emibiri yoshi erhali yo miguma: ogw’abantu gubà gwâgo, ogw’ensimba gwâgo, ogw’enyunyi gwâgo, n’ogw’enfî gwâgo. <verse eid="1CO 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Haligi emibiri y’eby’emalunga n’ey’ebya hano nshi; ci obulangale bw’ey’eby’emalunga bubà bwâgo, n’obulangale bw’ey’ebya hano nshi bwâgo. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Obulangale bw’izûba bubà bwâgo, n’obulangale bw’omwêzi bubà bwâgo, n’obulangale bw’enyenyêzi bwâgo. Ciru n’enyenyêzi erhalangashana kuguma n’eyindi. <verse eid="1CO 15:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Ntyo kwo biri n’oku bufûke bw’abafù. Omubiri gunarhwêrwe guli gwa kubola, gufûke gurhaciri gwa kubola. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Gurhwêrwa buzira bukuze, gufûke omu irenge; gurhwêrwa erhi ngonyi, gufûke guli muzibu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Banarhwêre omubiri gw’obunya-nyama, hafûke omubiri gw’obunya-mûka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Akabà habà omubiri gw’obunya-nyama, hanabà n’omubiri gw’obunya-mûka. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Ntyo kwo biyandisirwe, mpu: Omuntu murhanzi, Adamu, ajizirwe ciremwa cirimwo obuzîne; Adamu muzinda yêhe ajirwa mûka guhâna obuzîne<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Murh 2, 7</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Ci arhali ec’obunya-mûka co cirhag’iboneka; ec’obunya-mubiri co cirhanga: ec’obunya-mûka cikulikire. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Omuntu murhanzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuntu murhanzi, ye Adamu; owa kabiri, ye Yezu.</char></note> omu bidaka arhengaga, anali w’en’igulu; owa kabiri yêhe arhengaga empingu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Oku omuny’igulu ali ayôsire, kwo n’abany’igulu bayôrha, n’oku ow’omu mpingu ali ayôsire, kwo n’ab’o­mu mpingu bayôrha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adamu ahîre iburha lyâge obuzîne bw’omubiri; Kristu arhuhîre obuzîne bw’empingu.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Na kulyâla rhwalikwo enshusho y’omuny’igulu, kwo rhukwânîne rhujekwo n’enshusho y’ow’omu mpingu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bulya Kristu afûsire. kukwânîne nîrhu rhuyish’ifûka.</char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Kwo ndesire ntya, bene wîrhu: omubiri n’omukò<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omubiri n’omukò, bwo bwôrhere bw’omuntu nka arhalimwo buzîne bwa Nnâmahanga Kristu arhudwirhîre</char></note> birhankayîma omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda, n’eby’okubola birhankayîma omu birhankahash’ibola. <verse eid="1CO 15:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Nkolaga nammubwîra ihwe: rhweshi rhurhakafà, ci rhweshi rhwayish’ihinduka kundi kundi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balya bayish’ibà baciri en’igulu amango Kristu agaluka barhakafa, ci bahinduke.</char></note>; <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>oku irindo liguma, omu kugohya ntya, oku izù ly’omushekera muzinda; bulya bayish’ibûha omu mushekera, n’abafîre bayish’ifûka na emibiri erhankacifà, na nîrhu rhwayish’ihinduka kundi kundi. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Bulya ogûla mubiri gubola, kukwânîne guyambale obuhashe bw’okurhabola, n’ogu mubiri gufà, kukwânîne guyambale obuhashe bw’okurhafà.<verse eid="1CO 15:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufù, okuhima kwâwe ngahi kuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Ci amango ogu mubiri gubola gwabà gwamâyambala obuhashe bw’okurhabola n’ogu mubiri gufà guyambala obuhashe bw’okurhafà, ly’olu luderho lw’Amandiko lwayunjula: Olufù lwahimirwe, lwamirwa n’irenge. <verse eid="1CO 15:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>Lufù we<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Iz 25, 8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hoz 13, 14</ref>.</char></note>, okuhima kwâwe ngahi kuli? Lufù we, akababo kâwe ngahi kaligi? <verse eid="1CO 15:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Olufù ecâha ko kababo kâlwo, n’ecâha Irhegeko bwo buzibu bwâco. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Ci, nêci, Nyamuzinda akonkwa, owarhuhâga okuhimana erhi Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu orhuma! <verse eid="1CO 15:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Ntyo, bene wîrhu bazigirwa, musimike, murhadundaganaga, ensiku zoshi mukaz’ijà embere omu mukolo gwa Nyakasane, bulya mumanyire oku omukolo gwinyu muli Nyakasane gurhankafa busha.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="ms1">IV. Enfundiko</para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano. Omusingo. Obwangà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Kw’erya ntûlo y’okurhabâla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ntûlo y’okurhabâla abatagatîfu: Ezo nsholôlo zàli za kurhabâla abemêzi bakenyi b’e Yeruzalemu. </char></note> abatagatîfu, ninyu mujire nk’oku narhegekaga Ekleziya z’e Galasiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Olusiku lurhanzi lw’omugobe, ngasi muguma muli mwe abîke aha mwâge ebi asigazize, na ntyo barhalindaga mpu kuhika nyishe entûlo zibul’ihânwa. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Hano nyisha, nayanka abà mwene mucîshozire, mbafumbase obugo n’amaruba, ensholôlo zinyu bazihêke e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>N’akabà kukwânîne nâni nyije, banagenda haguma nâni. <verse eid="1CO 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Nayisha emwinyu hano mbà namagera omu Macedoniya, bulya kugera kône nagera omu Macedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Ci emwinyu yôhe nkaba nayishinga nsiku, ciru nankanagerezayo amango g’empondo goshi, mwene mubè mwe mumpisa ngasi aha nanajà. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Bulya ntalonza mmubone ngera ntya kwône; nnangâlîre nti nashinga kasanzi emwinyu, Nyakasane akayêmêra. <verse eid="1CO 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Ci kwône nâbêra e Efezi kuhika Pentekoste; <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>bulya banyigulireyo olumvi lwoshi oku mukolo gwâni, n’abashombanyi baliyo banji.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timoteyo akayisha, mumanye akahugalala omu karhî kinyu; bulyâla kwo akola akâni omukolo gwa Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Kuziga harhajiraga owamugayaguza. Muyish’imurhabâla ampikeho n'omurhûla, bulya ndwîrhe namulinga rhwe na bene wîrhu. <verse eid="1CO 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Mwene wîrhu Apolo naye, namugukulîre nti ajè emunda muli haguma na bene wîrhu; ci anywîre embuli mpu arhayije; ayijà amango ayumva amazire bushiru. <verse eid="1CO 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Mubè masù, musêre buzibu omu buyêmêre, mubè balume, munakomere! <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Muli mwe byoshi bijirwe omu buzigire.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Nashub’immubwîra cindi cinwa ciguma, bene wîrhu. Murhahabiri oku Stefana n’enyumpa yâge bo barhanzirhanzi b’omu Akaya, n’oku bacîhizire bône omu mukolo gw’okurhumikira abatagatîfu. <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>Ninyu mukâkenga abantu ba bene abo na ngasi yêshi okola n'orhama haguma nabo. <verse eid="1CO 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Nsîmire obûla Stefana bo na Fortunato n’Akayiko bal’intandûla, na ntyo barhûliriza idulwe linyu lyandi emurhima. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Nêci, bahûmwîre omurhima gwâni n’ogwinyu. Abà­ntu ba bene abo mukabakenga. <verse eid="1CO 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Ekleziya z’omu Aziya mpu asingi. Akwila bo na Priska bammulamusize bwenêne muli Nyakasane, n’endêko y’abemêzi babugânana aha mwâbo. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Bene wîrhu boshi bammulamusize. Mulamusanye n’ehinunugurho hitagatîfu. <verse eid="1CO 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Ogu musingo guli gwa kuboko kwâni niene, Paolo. <verse eid="1CO 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Orhazigira Nyakasane, akahera! «Maran atha!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Maran atha» erhi «Marana tha»: ziri nderho za ciharamiya. Kwo kuderha: Nyakasane, ayisha! erhi Nyakasane, yisha.</char></note> Nyakasane ayisha! <verse eid="1CO 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Enshôkano ya Nyakasane Yezu ebè haguma ninyu! <verse eid="1CO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Obuzigire bwâni kuli mwe mweshi muli Kristu Yezu!<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
